  },
  "domain": "Public finance (international)",
  "description": "A breach of a budget limit is a legal event in some countries (PFM-039, PFM-CH-7): the case records the facts, a person other than the reporter investigates and records responsibility and corrective action, the accounting officer reviews, and the report goes to the authorities the country configures, within the report deadline from DMN. Authorities and deadline are SYNTHETIC until the country confirms them.",
